chords | r/2 [bb3,d4,f4]' [a3,c4,eb4]' | r/2 [bb3,d4,f4]' [bb3,d4,f4]' | r/2 [a3,c4,eb4]' [a3,c4,eb4]' | r/2 [bb3,d4,f4]' [bb3,d4,f4]' |
drums  | K/2 X X           | K/2 X X           | K/2 X X           | K/2 S/1 S S S     |
'''

