chords | r/2 [a3,c4,f4]' [a3,c4,f4]' | r/2 [a3,c4,f4]' [a3,c4,f4]' | r/2 [bb3,c4,e4]' [bb3,c4,e4]' | r/2 [bb3,c4,e4]' [bb3,c4,e4]' |
